{"id":"n1-070","title":"Noun に限ったことでもない","romaji":"~ni kagitta koto demo nai","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"'Not limited to'; 'not just', 'not exclusively'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 'Noun に限ったことでもない' typically expresses that something is not only limited to a specific instance or category. It insinuates that there are also other instances or categories involved. In English, it can be translated as 'not limited to', 'not just', or 'not exclusively'.","formation":"Noun + に限ったことでもない","examples":[{"jp":"この試験が難しいのは、数学に限ったことでもない。","romaji":"Kono shiken ga muzukashii no wa, suugaku ni kagitta koto demo nai.","en":"The exam being difficult is not limited to just math.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"難しい","vocabId":"1460850","reading":"むずかしい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"数学","vocabId":"1372980","reading":"すうがく"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"限った","vocabId":"1264640","reading":"かぎった","baseForm":"限る"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[8,9,10,11,12,13]},{"jp":"彼女が可愛いのは顔だけに限ったことでもない。性格も好きだ。","romaji":"Kanojo ga kawaii no wa kao dake ni kagitta koto demo nai. Seikaku mo suki da.","en":"Her being cute is not just limited to her face. I also like her personality.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"可愛い","vocabId":"1577200","reading":"かわいい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"顔","vocabId":"1217730","reading":"かお"},{"surface":"だけ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"限った","vocabId":"1264640","reading":"かぎった","baseForm":"限る"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null},{"surface":"性格","vocabId":"1375290","reading":"せいかく"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"好き","vocabId":"1277450","reading":"すき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7,8,9,10,11,12]},{"jp":"その問題が起こるのは、我々の国に限ったことでもない。","romaji":"Sono mondai ga okoru no wa, wareware no kuni ni kagitta koto demo nai.","en":"The occurrence of that problem is not limited to our country.","words":[{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"問題","vocabId":"1536010","reading":"もんだい"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"起こる","vocabId":"1223680","reading":"おこる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"我々","vocabId":"1607050","reading":"われわれ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"国","vocabId":"1592250","reading":"くに"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"限った","vocabId":"1264640","reading":"かぎった","baseForm":"限る"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[10,11,12,13,14,15]},{"jp":"この作家の本が売れているのは日本に限ったことでもない。","romaji":"Kono sakka no hon ga urete iru no wa Nippon ni kagitta koto demo nai.","en":"The selling of this author's books is not limited to just Japan.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"作家","vocabId":"1297510","reading":"さっか"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"売れている","vocabId":"1473960","reading":"うれている","baseForm":"売れる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本","vocabId":"1582710","reading":"にっぽん"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"限った","vocabId":"1264640","reading":"かぎった","baseForm":"限る"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[9,10,11,12,13,14]}],"formalityLevel":"very-formal-literary","usageNote":"Formal, literary \"not only limited to...\". (でも variant of n1-069's ではない.)","family":{"id":"not-only-limited","name":"Not Only Limited To (Far From)","relatedPoints":["n2-096","n1-069"],"axis":"register"},"kind":"construction"}